(41310, 310, 283, '<td valign="top">I have that calculator too. Maybe you shouldn''t center the mirror, center is bad. Good idea though.</td>', 'I have that calculator too. Maybe you shouldn''t center the mirror, center is bad. Good idea though.', '2002-03-20 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
