(41325, 311, 156, '<td valign="top">love the background!</td>', 'love the background!', '2002-03-20 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41326, 311, 1, '<td valign="top">No idea what the title means-- but it looks to me like you''re peeing on the city.  Bravo!</td>', 'No idea what the title means-- but it looks to me like you''re peeing on the city.  Bravo!', '2002-03-20 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41327, 311, 102, '<td valign="top">Um, is that English? Not a bad photo though.</td>', 'Um, is that English? Not a bad photo though.', '2002-03-20 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41328, 311, 283, '<td valign="top">Cool affect. I like the shadow look. Would have been more dynamic if you were tilted and off centered.</td>', 'Cool affect. I like the shadow look. Would have been more dynamic if you were tilted and off centered.', '2002-03-20 19:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41329, 311, 637, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell alot about you!</td>', 'Can''t tell alot about you!', '2002-03-20 22:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41330, 311, 322, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! Even better if you let your face have some light. Maybe in profile or somesuch.</td>', 'Nicely done! Even better if you let your face have some light. Maybe in profile or somesuch.', '2002-03-23 15:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41331, 311, 245, '<td valign="top">Personally I think you should have won, your picture is way more emotional than mine! Congrats!</td>', 'Personally I think you should have won, your picture is way more emotional than mine! Congrats!', '2002-03-25 03:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(41332, 311, 446, '<td valign="top">I think this is a fabulous photo.  The subduded colors work nicely.  It evokes a very peaceful feeling for me.  I can imagine the city preparing to "tuck it in" for the night.  I can imagine many stories that could be told with this photograph.</td>', 'I think this is a fabulous photo.  The subduded colors work nicely.  It evokes a very peaceful feeling for me.  I can imagine the city preparing to "tuck it in" for the night.  I can imagine many stories that could be told with this photograph.', '2002-03-25 06:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(41333, 311, 1, '<td valign="top">Can you translate the title for us?</td>', 'Can you translate the title for us?', '2002-03-25 07:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(41334, 311, 698, '<td valign="top">This photo should have won.  The color contrast and sillohette is beautiful.  It caputures a mood instead of a look. I think this photographer has a future with a camera attached.</td>', 'This photo should have won.  The color contrast and sillohette is beautiful.  It caputures a mood instead of a look. I think this photographer has a future with a camera attached.', '2002-03-28 08:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(41335, 311, 139, '<td valign="top">Since nobody equipped to give a translation has done so, I''m going to try.<br/><br/>I think it''s Slovan (Yugoslavian), a language I know next to nothing about.  But I do know it''s slavic, and so is Russian, so I tried transliterating then translating from Russian and, with the help of my dictionaries and babelfish, I got something like this:<br/><br/>dole = part / piece / fraction<br/>ispod = underneath / bottom<br/>nogu = legs / foot<br/><br/>My best guess for mojih is "land".  So a very rough translation is that the phrase has something to do with him standing on part of the land.</td>', 'Since nobody equipped to give a translation has done so, I''m going to try.I think it''s Slovan (Yugoslavian), a language I know next to nothing about.  But I do know it''s slavic, and so is Russian, so I tried transliterating then translating from Russian and, with the help of my dictionaries and babelfish, I got something like this:dole = part / piece / fractionispod = underneath / bottomnogu = legs / footMy best guess for mojih is "land".  So a very rough translation is that the phrase has something to do with him standing on part of the land.', '2002-03-30 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(41336, 313, 203, '<td valign="top">I am sure it was ment as an effect but the blurr is distracting for me.</td>', 'I am sure it was ment as an effect but the blurr is distracting for me.', '2002-03-18 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41337, 313, 459, '<td valign="top">rock''n</td>', 'rock''n', '2002-03-18 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41338, 313, 205, '<td valign="top">Damn with all the musicians we could get a pretty cool band going</td>', 'Damn with all the musicians we could get a pretty cool band going', '2002-03-18 01:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41339, 313, 245, '<td valign="top">More contrast!</td>', 'More contrast!', '2002-03-18 03:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41340, 313, 543, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... there''s a whole lot "wrong" with this picture - flat tones, cropped head and hand,  all that space on the R, shadows on the cheesy backdrop, etc., but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt on the motion blur.  That said, it''s got that "so bad it''s good" thing going on in a way.  Kind of like the cr@p production values on Bob Marley recordings - adds flavor.  Cropped square from the right and with more contrast and a gamma adjustment, you''d have a nice back for a CD.  Need a bass player?</td>', 'Hmmm... there''s a whole lot "wrong" with this picture - flat tones, cropped head and hand,  all that space on the R, shadows on the cheesy backdrop, etc., but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt on the motion blur.  That said, it''s got that "so bad it''s good" thing going on in a way.  Kind of like the cr@p production values on Bob Marley recordings - adds flavor.  Cropped square from the right and with more contrast and a gamma adjustment, you''d have a nice back for a CD.  Need a bass player?', '2002-03-18 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41341, 313, 346, '<td valign="top">Really great image. Good compostion.</td>', 'Really great image. Good compostion.', '2002-03-18 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41342, 313, 215, '<td valign="top">b&amp;w adds a nice touch</td>', 'b&w adds a nice touch', '2002-03-20 08:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
