(41344, 313, 283, '<td valign="top">I like this...its off centered and has a lot of action going on. Rock on man. But the colors are kind of dull, more contrast would have been cool.</td>', 'I like this...its off centered and has a lot of action going on. Rock on man. But the colors are kind of dull, more contrast would have been cool.', '2002-03-20 19:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
