(41377, 317, 543, '<td valign="top">You don''t *look* like a transvestite.  ;-)  I kind of like the idea of you and the tube, but I think you''d have a stronger image without the overexposure on your face and reflection on the screen.  How about tuning the tv to some static, and using a polarizer?  I''d take the speaker and candles off the set, too.</td>', 'You don''t *look* like a transvestite.  ;-)  I kind of like the idea of you and the tube, but I think you''d have a stronger image without the overexposure on your face and reflection on the screen.  How about tuning the tv to some static, and using a polarizer?  I''d take the speaker and candles off the set, too.', '2002-03-18 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
