(41432, 322, 178, '<td valign="top">yes, I reach the tripod and turn it. Tripod was really close. <br/>right face was lit with flash, then quickly turn the tripod head and change my face, the remaining exposure(0.9sec??) of it will register my second face.  Thanks to Canon G1, which allows me to see myself with the twist and turn LCD. This was the 2nd shot out out 6 tries.</td>', 'yes, I reach the tripod and turn it. Tripod was really close. right face was lit with flash, then quickly turn the tripod head and change my face, the remaining exposure(0.9sec??) of it will register my second face.  Thanks to Canon G1, which allows me to see myself with the twist and turn LCD. This was the 2nd shot out out 6 tries.', '2002-03-30 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 0),
