(41451, 325, 173, '<td valign="top">Great photo!</td>', 'Great photo!', '2002-03-18 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41452, 325, 543, '<td valign="top">It''s really hard to do the constructive criticism thing when you''re looking at me like that.  Great eyes and smile.  The tones are excellent, too.  I''d really like to see this in portrait orientation so you could include all of your hand (oh, yeah... your pose is very good, too) and at least the feeling of the top of your head,  Even if it blends with the bg, I''d like there to be just a little more room.  Digging for nits, I could do without the clasp on the beads, and the highlights on the glasses show some oversharpening.  Very nice work.</td>', 'It''s really hard to do the constructive criticism thing when you''re looking at me like that.  Great eyes and smile.  The tones are excellent, too.  I''d really like to see this in portrait orientation so you could include all of your hand (oh, yeah... your pose is very good, too) and at least the feeling of the top of your head,  Even if it blends with the bg, I''d like there to be just a little more room.  Digging for nits, I could do without the clasp on the beads, and the highlights on the glasses show some oversharpening.  Very nice work.', '2002-03-18 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41453, 325, 279, '<td valign="top">Nice, but looks like an advertisment. :)</td>', 'Nice, but looks like an advertisment. :)', '2002-03-18 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
