(41562, 337, 279, '<td valign="top">To langdon: Just messed with the levels. I''d taken the picture with a satin black backdrop behind me and stood a ways in front of it. Then very bright lights on my face very close to me and a fast shutter speed. It took me a few shots to get the metering right, but eventually got it so my face was lit up normal-looking but the background faded to solid black. You could still see a TINY amount of detail, but a quick level adjust in photoshop fixed it.</td>', 'To langdon: Just messed with the levels. I''d taken the picture with a satin black backdrop behind me and stood a ways in front of it. Then very bright lights on my face very close to me and a fast shutter speed. It took me a few shots to get the metering right, but eventually got it so my face was lit up normal-looking but the background faded to solid black. You could still see a TINY amount of detail, but a quick level adjust in photoshop fixed it.', '2002-03-29 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
