(41952, 402, 101, '<td valign="top">i love how there seems to be a story behind this photo... comical, the sweet little dog licking your forehead in contrast to your intense stare.</td>', 'i love how there seems to be a story behind this photo... comical, the sweet little dog licking your forehead in contrast to your intense stare.', '2002-03-20 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41953, 402, 283, '<td valign="top">dude there''s something on ur head!...i think your wig is hungry. But serious what is that?</td>', 'dude there''s something on ur head!...i think your wig is hungry. But serious what is that?', '2002-03-20 20:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41954, 402, 69, '<td valign="top">your dog rules.</td>', 'your dog rules.', '2002-03-21 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41955, 402, 459, '<td valign="top">Yes, it is.</td>', 'Yes, it is.', '2002-03-21 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41956, 402, 322, '<td valign="top">Clever, and great timing!</td>', 'Clever, and great timing!', '2002-03-23 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41957, 402, 261, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2002-03-24 00:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41958, 403, 245, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but I think it could be dimmer and more comfortable. The room feels awkwardly tilted, too.</td>', 'I like the composition, but I think it could be dimmer and more comfortable. The room feels awkwardly tilted, too.', '2002-03-18 03:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41959, 403, 173, '<td valign="top">Hard to tell how you incorporated the mirror for the challenge, and the out stretched arm.</td>', 'Hard to tell how you incorporated the mirror for the challenge, and the out stretched arm.', '2002-03-18 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41960, 403, 327, '<td valign="top">I''d of cropped this different but it''s an interesting picture and the pictures on the wall tell us something about you.<br/>Liked it!</td>', 'I''d of cropped this different but it''s an interesting picture and the pictures on the wall tell us something about you.Liked it!', '2002-03-18 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41961, 403, 283, '<td valign="top">Hello professor, I had a few questions about your lecture today.  Thats what this picture reminds me of.</td>', 'Hello professor, I had a few questions about your lecture today.  Thats what this picture reminds me of.', '2002-03-20 20:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41962, 404, 210, '<td valign="top">Amazingly captures the essence of traveling when we''re... well, older.  Absolutely loved this one.  The only thing that kept me from giving it a 10 was the lack of focus on the right-- but nonetheless, beautiful.</td>', 'Amazingly captures the essence of traveling when we''re... well, older.  Absolutely loved this one.  The only thing that kept me from giving it a 10 was the lack of focus on the right-- but nonetheless, beautiful.', '2002-03-18 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41963, 404, 245, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite shots. Normally I hate a visible camera in a picture like this, but here it''s part of the story, everyone''s obviously reacting to it. The light and emotion is warm and familiar, yet classy. Very nice.</td>', 'This is one of my favorite shots. Normally I hate a visible camera in a picture like this, but here it''s part of the story, everyone''s obviously reacting to it. The light and emotion is warm and familiar, yet classy. Very nice.', '2002-03-18 03:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41964, 404, 173, '<td valign="top">Fun photo, lots going on and keeps the eye''s attention.</td>', 'Fun photo, lots going on and keeps the eye''s attention.', '2002-03-18 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(41965, 404, 543, '<td valign="top">If the waiter (great catch on his expression) were standing in front of that glare, the composition would be much better.  Cropping 10% left and bottom helps.  As it is, I love the way the mirrors draw me into the scene.  There''s so much to see, and the warm cast really gives a sense of being there and matches the expressions.  That Fuji''s a photogenic little piece of kit.  Nice work.</td>', 'If the waiter (great catch on his expression) were standing in front of that glare, the composition would be much better.  Cropping 10% left and bottom helps.  As it is, I love the way the mirrors draw me into the scene.  There''s so much to see, and the warm cast really gives a sense of being there and matches the expressions.  That Fuji''s a photogenic little piece of kit.  Nice work.', '2002-03-20 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
